{"id":"n47389-1-4","stage":4,"title":"더부룩하다 · 胃胀","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n47389-1-4-1","ko":"밥을 너무 많이 먹었는지 배가 더부룩해.","zh":"我好像吃太多饭了，肚子好胀啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밥을","meaning":"饭，餐","explanation":"밥：饭，餐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"2","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밥을","audio":"/audio/59f360b400889823dcc4.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"먹었는지","meaning":"服，吃","explanation":"먹다：服，吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"3","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹었는지","audio":"/audio/446854da4aeaf7682bea.mp3"}},{"text":"배가","meaning":"肚子","explanation":"배：肚子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20211","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배가","audio":"/audio/c5a9b1ff55fc80e6120e.mp3"}},{"text":"더부룩해.","meaning":"胃胀","explanation":"더부룩하다：胃胀；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"더부룩하다","audio":"/audio/72a9a25f5b4daae82528.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47389","senseId":"1","lemma":"더부룩하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더부룩해","audio":"/audio/958bc638131b8203c1b3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭，餐","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"每天在一定时间吃的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"服，吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将药物放进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"肚子","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"20211","definition":"人或动物的身体中胸部以下、腿部以上的部分。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"72a9a25f5b4daae8","term":"더부룩하다","zh":"胃胀","audio":"/audio/72a9a25f5b4daae82528.mp3","entryId":"47389","definition":"消化不良，肚子不舒服。","pronunciation":["더부루카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d7c432319bacd72ba370.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n47389-1-4-2","ko":"소화제 먹어야겠다.","zh":"得吃点助消化的药了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"소화제","meaning":"消化药","explanation":"소화제：消化药","readings":[{"term":"소화제","audio":"/audio/537350695b5122843a1d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64127","senseId":"1","lemma":"소화제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소화제","audio":"/audio/537350695b5122843a1d.mp3"}},{"text":"먹어야겠다.","meaning":"服，吃","explanation":"먹다：服，吃；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"3","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹어야겠다","audio":"/audio/a8ee88c464c128b9acfd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"537350695b512284","term":"소화제","zh":"消化药","au